      "updated": 1792222490237,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Also enforced by the database, not by application code:\ncomposite (org_id, id) foreign keys, so rows never link across orgs;  an org always keeps an active admin;\nwho may decide an approval, before expiry, once;  one primary role per person;  an audit log the app cannot edit.\nEvery tenant table has an isolation test, and the mutation suite proves the tests catch a weakened rule.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 83,
      "containerId": "note",
      "originalText": "Also enforced by the database, not by application code:\ncomposite (org_id, id) foreign keys, so rows never link across orgs;  an org always keeps an active admin;\nwho may decide an approval, before expiry, once;  one primary role per person;  an audit log the app cannot edit.\nEvery tenant table has an isolation test, and the mutation suite proves the tests catch a weakened rule.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
